+## Reordering a past order
+
+Each order page has a **Reorder** button. It opens the new-order form
+(`/orders/new?reorder=<order id>`) filled in from that order; nothing is placed until
+you submit the form.
+
+- Quantities are copied for products that are still active. Products that are no
+  longer available are left out, and the form lists them.
+- Prices are always today's prices, not the prices on the original order.
+- Delivery due date and requested ship date are left blank; the shipping method is
+  copied from the original order.
+- Customers can reorder only their own orders. Staff can reorder any order, and the
+  account is preselected.
+
 ## Using this for the Claude training exercises
 
 Three integration points, each independent of the others:
